<title>LITHUANIA: SOCCER-LITHUANIA BEAT LIECHTENSTEIN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LITHUANIA BEAT LIECHTENSTEIN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania beat Liechtenstein 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup group eight qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Lithuania - Edgaras Jankauskas (43rd), Arminas Narbekovas (55th)</p>
<p>Liechtenstein - Harry Zech (53rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
